'''Level 1315''' was an [[Coruscant Underworld|underworld]] level on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. It was so named because it was located one thousand, three hundred, and fifteen levels from the core of the [[ecumenopolis]], which was accessed by the [[underworld portal]].<ref name="Catch a Jedi" />

